# Scratch used while narrowing a finding down: one-off probes, bisects and
# explorations. They are throwaway by design -- each one existed to answer a single
# question, hardcodes whatever ports and row counts that question needed, and is
# superseded by whichever committed test_*_e2e.py suite came out of it.
#
# Keeping them out of the tree is deliberate: a reader cannot tell a probe that
# proves something from a probe that was abandoned halfway, so committing them would
# add 45 files of ambiguous authority next to 19 suites of clear authority.
_*.py
_*.json
scratch_explore.py
